Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:26.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}On and on the Great River rolls, racing east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:35.13,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of proud and gallant heroes,\N its white waves leave no trace,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:44.71,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}as right and wrong, glory and fall,\N fade at once into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:49.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet ever the green hills stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:53.95,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to blaze in the west-waning day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:06.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The white-haired fishermen and lumberjacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:10.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}on the river banks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:18.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}looking on the autumn moons and spring breezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:26.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With a jar of wine, they gather in merriment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:30.04,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The countless tales of present and past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:41.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}all in their jests!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:49.55,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With a jar of wine, they gather in merriment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:52.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The countless tales of present and past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:03:09.15,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}all in their jests!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:15.08,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3350,4120)\pos(640,481.6)}Act 1\N\N\N\N\N\N\NDeer-Hunt of Heroes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:21.68,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1500,4940,6160)\pos(640,368.8)}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:21.68,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,556)\fade(255,0,255,0,1500,4940,6160)}Oath of the Peach Garden
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:43.22,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,As an ancient adage goes:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:49.47,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,"The world, long divided, must unite; long united, must divide."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:54.03,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,During the Spring and Autumn era,\Nfive hegemons strove for supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:58.24,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,During the Warring States era,\Nseven kingdoms clashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:00.74,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After five centuries of constant strife,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:04.34,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the realm was united under the Qin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.79,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After the fall of the Qin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:09.87,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,contention between the Chu and Han erupted;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:13.99,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the realm was united under the Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:22.43,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the second year of the\N Zhanghe era of Eastern Han, or 88 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:26.55,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the ten-year-old Emperor He of Han was enthroned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.43,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,With the help of eunuchs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:30.85,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,he was able to depose Empress Dowager Dou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:34.72,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and her elder brother, Grand General Dou Xian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:38.04,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Eunuchs then participated in politics;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:43.68,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,it was this moment that began the eunuch domination during the waning years of the Han dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:58.45,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Long live!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:59.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(301,412.09)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2650,2940)}Emperor Hé of Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:05.83,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Long live!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.47,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Over the next few decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:17.80,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,there was internal strife as the eunuchs amassed more power.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.60,0:05:21.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(951.023,413.248)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3100,3540)}Emperor Shāng of Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:21.04,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,For the likes of Emperor Shang of Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:24.92,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(954.498,442.186)}Emperor Ān
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:23.64,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Emperor An,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:28.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(478.407,422.508)}Emperor Shùn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:27.09,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Emperor Shun,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:32.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(963.765,399.357)}Emperor Chōng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:30.74,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Emperor Chong,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:35.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.448,472.283)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2660,3020)}Emperor Zhì
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:34.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Emperor Zhi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(308.127,464.18)}Emperor Huán
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.98,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Emperor Huan, and Emperor Ling,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:40.93,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,emperorship shifted constantly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:43.62,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the power of the court withered by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:46.56,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Local gentry became despots, extorting the people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:50.07,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,annexing land as natural disasters erupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:56.21,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thus, the people were struggling\N on the brink of starvation and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(333.611,475.756)}Zhāng Jiǎo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:17.61,Default,Yellow Scarves,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Old Heaven is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:23.68,Default,Yellow Scarves,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Yellow Heaven shall rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:29.51,Default,Yellow Scarves,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}On the year of Jiazi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.51,0:06:36.08,Default,Yellow Scarves,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}all shall prosper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:49.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,553.6)}The Yellow Scarves Rebellion
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:48.20,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Driven to the brink by the government, the people could only rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:51.94,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thousands upon thousands of starving people raised their flags high,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:54.21,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,for one last, desperate push against fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:59.44,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the first month of the seventh year \Nof the Guanghe era, or January 184 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:59.44,Note (Potential style?),Narrator,0,0,0,,Note: The Jiazi year was the first in the sexagenary year cycle. 184 CE corresponded to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:02.69,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the Yellow Scarves Rebellion broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:06.34,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Their army burned government buildings,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.17,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,murdered officials, and occupied cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:12.17,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The embers of war spread quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:14.82,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Within ten days, the world joined them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:17.16,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,shaking the imperial court to its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:24.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,440,6260,10740)\pos(322.027,447.974)}Hé Jìn\NStyled: Suìgāo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:26.00,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Style names are given upon reaching adulthood. They are used as a form of respect between people of the same generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:24.22,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the imperial army is\N weak before the Yellow Scarves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:27.36,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Permit the provinces to recruit troops for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334.769,441.029)}Emperor Líng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:29.77,Default,Emperor Ling,0,0,0,,I depend on you, Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.85,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Let us also send generals \Nwith troops to crush the rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:36.06,Default,Emperor Ling,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.83,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:57.23,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Administrator Liu Yan of You Province
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:08:01.09,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}hereby makes this proclamation to the public:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.09,0:08:05.06,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"The Yellow Scarves have committed treason against the Majesty,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:06.88,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"assembling an army and rebelling."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:11.38,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"They are now invading the lands of You Province,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:15.98,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"killing anyone and corrupting the people."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:20.28,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"To prevent inadequate defenses of this land,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:22.68,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"we have received an imperial edict"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:25.55,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"to recruit strong men from all four corners"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:29.88,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"who will reinforce the army and protect the people."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:34.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,464.318)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:37.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(978.944,484.773)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:39.28,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Instead of helping your nation, you're sighing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:40.64,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Aren't you a man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:52.12,Default,Gate Guy,0,0,0,,The market is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:56.48,Default,Gate Guy,0,0,0,,The market is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.04,Default,Gate Guy,0,0,0,,The market is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.26,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Butcher Zhang?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:11.17,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Butcher Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:13.72,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Hey! Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:17.69,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm so sorry! I'm afraid you can't eat—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:19.00,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,You're here, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:19.90,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Cut me some meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.90,0:09:21.84,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,How can I get it if my boss isn't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:24.22,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,I don't care! You sell the meat and I'll buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:25.63,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,I have money, so sell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:27.31,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Call for Butcher Zhang now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:30.28,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Then do it yourself! I wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.36,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,What sort of butcher is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.60,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Just call him over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.51,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Brother, this is your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:38.74,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Why be afraid? Just sell the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:39.30,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:40.27,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Sell? That...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:42.73,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,You sell it. I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:44.92,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Meat's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.06,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,To tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:52.92,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,the meat's in that well, but\N I'm telling you I can't get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:54.61,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,I can't get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:56.80,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Can't you get it by moving the millstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:09:59.93,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Move it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.01,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,You move this millstone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:05.74,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,I'll also tell you something my boss said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:07.54,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,"Whoever can move this millstone"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:10.01,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,"can keep the meat inside."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:13.14,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:15.60,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Move it and the meat is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:21.16,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,But won't your boss lose his money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:22.48,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Well well well!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:24.38,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,If you can't move this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:26.06,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,quit running your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:28.18,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,It's his problem if money's lost or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.03,0:10:31.78,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:40.68,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Move it, my good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:41.88,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:53.57,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,That...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:54.57,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Where do you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:55.92,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Put it back in place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:00.95,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:06.30,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Sir, oh powerful sir, what do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.60,0:11:09.09,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Cut it into small pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:10.19,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Give it to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.15,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Give it out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:15.72,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,The meat belongs to me now, do as I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.94,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! I'll give it out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:41.60,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Come everyone, get some meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.25,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,This meat is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:44.75,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Just take it, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:54.36,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Go, get me a piece! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:11:58.40,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,You came to buy meat, so pay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:03.03,Default,Buyer Lackey,0,0,0,,The other people are getting it, so why not us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:03.84,Default,Buyer,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.19,0:12:08.78,Default,Buyer Lackey,0,0,0,,I can't pay! Pass me money!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.86,Default,Buyer Lackey,0,0,0,,Here, here, here! We'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:02.56,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:02.94,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:03.50,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:04.18,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.09,0:13:07.10,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:08.59,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,That's nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:33.98,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Good green beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:34.96,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Want to buy some?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:02.50,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What green beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.28,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,This is clearly flour!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:08.32,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I sell fine products at a fair price.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:12.91,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,It's nothing but flour!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:15.45,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Are you buying them or are you milling them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:16.60,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,If you won't buy, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:19.98,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I pinch a few beans and you're whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:22.67,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You gave away my pork!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.11,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Got anything to say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.87,0:14:28.11,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,So you've come for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:35.37,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You're the one I want to beat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.82,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,If I want to do great deeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:28.42,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,how could these two not be good companions?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:35.09,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,They truly are extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.09,0:15:37.26,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,They are both real men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:07.86,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You two fighters display great prowess in martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:11.00,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Admirable, very admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:14.00,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.55,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Hey, tough guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:20.69,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I heard you lifted that millstone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:23.87,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,so I came to see for myself \Nwhat kind of man you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:30.04,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I thought you came to demand money for the pork.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:39.01,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Why mention that little piece of pork?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:39.60,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:42.21,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I invite you two to my place for a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:44.61,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,It's about to rain, so it'll be a nice refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:45.02,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:45.58,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:46.30,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:09.31,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'm Zhang Fei, styled Yide!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.31,0:17:11.44,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I love befriending heroes in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:13.32,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Today, I'm lucky to meet two new heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:15.12,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,It's really put me in a good mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:16.54,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,After you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:18.76,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Hurry, after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.17,0:17:21.32,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Men, bring wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.09,0:17:26.74,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I am Guan Yu, styled Yunchang,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:28.27,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,of Xieliang in Hedong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:36.00,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am Liu Bei, styled Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:39.36,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:44.47,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,We three have met by chance, \Nyet we're just like old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.47,0:17:45.14,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.08,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:51.43,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Have a seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:59.77,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I have noticed that you two are no ordinary men.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:04.08,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,At present, the Yellow Scarves are \Nrunning amok and the realm is in chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:06.00,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Mighty heroes have also risen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:09.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I wonder if you two heroes have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:13.84,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,When I lived in Xieliang,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:16.77,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand a local despot's oppression,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:18.40,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,so I killed him in a fit of rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:21.89,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,As a result, I've been on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:24.29,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,It's been five or six years since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:27.06,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I have many skills that I want to put to use,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:29.36,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,but I can only wander the land...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.52,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,without a way to repay the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.98,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What's wrong with killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:35.92,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I hate that I haven't killed all the villains in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:45.86,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I saw the recruitment notice at the city gate today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:47.62,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I intend to enlist in the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:49.91,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,With weapons, I shall risk my life in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:53.33,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Even if I fall in battle, I do so as a true man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:54.12,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:18:58.51,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,That's what a man ought to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:01.61,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'll enlist with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:11.30,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:13.23,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Will you enlist with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:21.74,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What's with the long sigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:25.58,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Are you implying that men shouldn't help their state?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:30.06,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We are in troubled times right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:33.38,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In troubled times do heroes emerge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:38.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}For heroes like you two, {\bord12}now is the time to show your valor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:41.29,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But why must you subject yourselves under others?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:42.72,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Have you not heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:47.40,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Just as times defines its heroes, heroes define their times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:57.63,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now the Yellow Scarves have rebelled {\bord12}and the realm responds to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:02.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}The court ordered the provinces to recruit strong defenders
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:05.82,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}because they themselves are weak, feeble, and leaderless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:08.30,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}While the eunuchs monopolize power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:13.74,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Thus, another rebellion against tyranny is bound to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:19.58,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When the Yellow Scarves are crushed, {\bord12}that will be when heroes rise forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:22.81,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}As for who will control the realm under Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.81,0:20:25.98,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}we cannot know just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:29.16,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Hearing you once beats ten years of reading!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:31.09,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Admirable, really admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:33.84,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'm just a pig butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:36.14,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I don't know what's happening in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:38.31,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Just give the word and I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:47.84,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You're someone who really doesn't seem happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:02.30,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}There is a certain man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:04.10,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He is a scion of the Han dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:09.99,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}His ancestor, Prince Jing of Zhongshan, {\bord12}was the seventh son of Emperor Jing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.36,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Later, another ancestor, the Marquis of Zhuolu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:17.61,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}failing to pay annual tribute, was stripped of land and title.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:25.01,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}A branch of his family wandered into the land of Zhuo, and settled at Lousang Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:26.55,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lousang Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:28.43,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I know about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.37,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A thousand-year-old mulberry tree is there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:35.54,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}Its trunk is tall and its crown is wide,\Nwhich is how Lousang Village got its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:35.54,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Lousang literally means "towering mulberry tree."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:39.88,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I've heard of a saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:43.12,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"From Luosang village shall a noble man emerge!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:47.52,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Indeed, I am familiar with that saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:58.01,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}However, the eighteenth-generational descendant has but four walls for a house,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.01,0:22:00.06,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}bearing no wealth within it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:02.42,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Since he is an imperial scion,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:05.89,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}why isn't he restoring his family's honor and rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:15.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}When he was fifteen years old, he began searching for teachers and friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:19.47,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He often thinks of serving\N the state and protecting the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.29,0:22:27.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet now... He is twenty eight years old and has achieved nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:33.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In the end, all he has left are vain aspirations...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.22,0:22:38.24,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}... And a heart full of tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.70,0:22:41.24,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:47.40,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Truth to be told...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.43,0:22:50.08,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,He is right before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.69,0:22:55.41,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say this earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.41,0:22:57.33,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,The noble man is before my eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.33,0:23:00.19,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Brother Liu, just give the word and I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.26,0:23:04.26,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:10.82,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I want to recruit warriors and punish traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.44,0:23:13.34,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I just do not have any resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:19.00,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:20.30,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:22.32,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'm willing to work together with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:25.32,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:27.22,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I always speak the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:29.03,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.77,0:23:33.68,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:42.67,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,A lone thread cannot make a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:45.94,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,A lone tree cannot make a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.59,0:23:48.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am lone and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.93,0:23:52.36,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,If you don't give up, I'll gladly follow you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:57.68,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You two are as charcoal during a blizzard,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.68,0:23:59.16,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,treating me with such sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:09.24,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Please accept my respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:10.84,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.84,0:24:12.73,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Brother Liu, no need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.26,0:24:17.42,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,In the pursuit of doing great deeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.01,0:24:24.67,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I have wandered for half of my life, \Nstruggling to find like-minded people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.03,0:24:26.51,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,But here I am today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.24,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,After washing away sand, I found gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.24,0:24:30.91,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Heaven must have taken pity
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:33.93,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,and delivered you two heroes to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.18,0:24:41.08,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I want to swear an oath of brotherhood \Nwith you two, sharing life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:43.80,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How do you two feel about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.92,0:24:46.43,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I've always wanted this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.07,0:24:50.39,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,With us three being of the same heart, \Nwe can change clay to gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.39,0:24:51.87,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Now that you have me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.87,0:24:54.04,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,we can do great things!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.74,0:24:57.90,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Although I'm just a fighter,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.90,0:24:59.91,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I understand loyalty and justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.53,0:25:01.40,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,It is said,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.40,0:25:04.04,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,"A bird chooses a fine tree to perch on;"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.04,0:25:06.72,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,"a subject chooses a worthy lord to serve."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:09.44,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,My lifelong wish is now fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.85,0:25:11.18,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:13.70,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,my life is bound to your life;
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.70,0:25:16.06,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,my flesh is bound to your flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.06,0:25:18.81,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I'll follow your wishes without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:20.92,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Same with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.20,0:25:24.66,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I swear to share any hardship with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.66,0:25:27.50,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I'll accompany you in life and follow you to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.50,0:25:28.68,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Same with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.04,0:25:32.14,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,If I betray these words, may Heaven smite us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.74,0:25:34.28,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Same with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.58,0:25:37.48,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.48,0:25:38.76,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:40.52,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.27,0:25:44.32,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:47.96,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:51.33,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.33,0:25:54.48,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,We seek not to be born on the same day \Nof the same month in the same year!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.48,0:25:57.81,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,We seek not to be born on the same day \Nof the same month in the same year!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.81,0:26:00.75,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,We seek not to be born on the same day \Nof the same month in the same year!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.75,0:26:05.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,We seek only to die on the same day \Nof the same month in the same year!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:10.14,Default,All,0,0,0,,We seek only to die on the same day \Nof the same month in the same year!
