Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.72,0:30:53.48,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Where are you, traitor!?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.66,0:31:17.74,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Thank you, heroes, for your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.74,0:31:20.10,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I'll never forget it for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.54,0:31:23.60,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}May I ask what ranks you three hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.56,0:31:26.48,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We are commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.48,0:31:27.65,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Commoners?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.35,0:32:40.80,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder brother, don't you feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.68,0:32:43.69,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,annoyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.00,0:32:46.27,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother, don't bother Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.69,0:32:48.05,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You achieved so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.05,0:32:50.61,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,yet your prize is some commandant post in Anxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.05,0:32:51.96,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: The commandant is a lower county post, subordinate to the county magistrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.61,0:32:53.93,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,That Sun Jian just sucked up and was made a major!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:55.11,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.11,0:32:57.75,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,That stinking court deserves its rebellions!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:32:59.77,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother, watch your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.10,0:33:02.92,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,He was appointed by the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.92,0:33:04.35,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Do not do anything rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.12,0:33:06.62,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,And that Dong Zhuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.62,0:33:09.30,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,He did nothing, yet he was given a county magistrate's rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.30,0:33:11.16,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,All because he allied with the wealthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.16,0:33:13.61,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,and bribed the Ten Attendants for his post!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.16,0:33:15.44,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,The Ten Attendants are a faction of eunuchs that dominated the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.61,0:33:15.44,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,That day on the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.44,0:33:17.15,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,remember what he was like?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.15,0:33:19.30,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Fleeing like a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.30,0:33:20.84,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,If we didn't save him...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.88,0:33:25.22,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,If it was up to me, I'd kill him myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.87,0:33:30.48,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.72,0:33:49.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334.561,346.767)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4080,4480)}The Supervisor
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.15,0:33:49.02,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Are you the commandant of this county?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.34,0:33:50.01,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.83,0:33:52.36,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.90,0:33:53.76,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.74,0:33:55.71,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Ah, Liu Bei?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:58.16,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,What is your background?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.51,0:34:01.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am descended from Emperor Jing \Nthrough Prince Jing of Zhongshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.35,0:34:05.96,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,You are an imperial scion?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.67,0:34:07.56,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.69,0:34:17.52,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,So sorry, so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.89,0:34:19.28,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,No need for apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.74,0:34:21.65,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Since you are an imperial scion,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.65,0:34:23.56,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,please sit and let us talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.56,0:34:24.92,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.99,0:34:36.97,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Liu Bei, you are a scion of the Han dynasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.97,0:34:39.99,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,so why are you just a mere county commandant?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.05,0:34:43.97,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Regardless of my post, I will do my best for the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.59,0:34:48.43,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Who recommended you to take this post?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.77,0:34:54.77,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I raised troops in Zhuo Commandery, \Nfighting the rebels in over thirty battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.77,0:34:57.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I got this post due to my trivial merits.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.84,0:35:05.72,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,You should find a big tree in the court to lean on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.72,0:35:09.99,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,You can then enjoy the shade under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.67,0:35:12.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.37,0:35:24.96,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,With that being said,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.52,0:35:29.85,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,serving in lower ranks is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.85,0:35:31.99,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Serving in higher ranks...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.45,0:35:35.20,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.83,0:35:38.12,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,If you want to do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.12,0:35:40.55,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,you always need money...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.55,0:35:45.11,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,to pile up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.75,0:35:51.67,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am an honest official.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.67,0:35:54.16,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I have never hurt the people in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.16,0:36:01.18,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,You have never hurt them in the slightest?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.68,0:36:03.31,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.75,0:36:05.36,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I dare not deceive you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.74,0:36:10.98,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Since you are so confident in yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.98,0:36:13.89,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,I will do a quick investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.90,0:36:23.79,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.79,0:36:25.47,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Any trouble, Elder Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.47,0:36:27.44,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.49,0:36:29.63,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.25,0:36:39.91,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,He didn't ask for a bribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.35,0:36:43.83,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,He was hinting at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.83,0:36:47.00,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,However, I pretended like I did not understand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.87,0:36:49.99,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I could never hurt the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.99,0:36:51.70,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How could I bribe him?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.04,0:36:53.90,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Even if you could, you shouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.37,0:36:55.79,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Let's see what he can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.79,0:36:56.88,Default,Official Wang,0,0,0,,Commandant Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.00,0:36:59.36,Default,Official Wang,0,0,0,,The Supervisor wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.91,0:37:00.86,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.06,0:37:02.30,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,The Supervisor again?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.19,0:37:05.85,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,He's just a bully with influence! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.05,0:37:10.72,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,The Supervisor has a reason for calling you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.58,0:37:13.27,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Best to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.27,0:37:14.72,Default,Official Wang,0,0,0,,You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.07,0:37:18.32,Default,Official Wang,0,0,0,,The Supervisor must have ill intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.08,0:37:20.59,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.63,0:37:28.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Yunchang and Third Brother, wait for me at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.84,0:37:30.15,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Official Wang, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.15,0:37:30.59,Default,Official Wang,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.52,0:37:38.87,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.87,0:37:39.46,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.34,0:37:41.96,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,What is your background?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.96,0:37:45.00,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am descended from Emperor Jing \Nthrough Prince Jing of Zhongshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.00,0:37:46.08,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.59,0:37:48.56,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,You dare pretend to be an imperial scion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.98,0:37:50.08,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I would not dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.08,0:37:51.36,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,And you dare talk back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.70,0:37:53.46,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,How did you get this post?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.46,0:37:54.84,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,How much did you bribe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.84,0:37:56.24,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Hurry up and tell the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.92,0:38:01.10,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I raised troops in Zhuo Commandery, \Nfighting the rebels in over thirty battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.10,0:38:03.43,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I got this post due to my trivial merits.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.43,0:38:05.25,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,How dare you lie about your feats!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.25,0:38:06.41,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I would never lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:12.62,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,This time, I shall vanquish corrupt officials like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.62,0:38:13.82,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Then investigate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.28,0:38:15.26,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.69,0:38:18.12,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Once your sins are found out, I will come after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.66,0:38:19.49,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.59,0:38:29.47,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,This Liu Bei is very stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.35,0:38:33.86,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,Supervisor, as the saying goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.86,0:38:37.66,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,"The bite of a thief goes down to the bone."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.86,0:38:39.14,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: This means that false accusations are damaging and hard to refute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.22,0:38:43.93,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,The Supervisor is holding open hearings for three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.93,0:38:45.53,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,During these three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.53,0:38:47.96,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,anyone who is discontent with the commandant,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.96,0:38:50.92,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,has experienced injustice, corruption, or oppression,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.92,0:38:53.14,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,and has evidence of misappropriation,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.14,0:38:55.75,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,will all be heard out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.75,0:38:59.30,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,The Supervisor will support you, so do not be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.39,0:39:02.90,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,Listen to me clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.44,0:39:05.28,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,Pay injustice with justice;
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.28,0:39:06.89,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,pay unfairness with fairness!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.84,0:39:11.32,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Good sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.32,0:39:14.10,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,since Commandant Liu took office,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.10,0:39:16.71,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,he's done us no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.71,0:39:18.83,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,He loves the people like his own children!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.58,0:39:22.26,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,He's truly done nothing bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.26,0:39:24.84,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's done nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.12,0:39:27.76,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,Did he threaten you in private?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.76,0:39:31.25,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Nothing like that! Absolutely nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.25,0:39:32.59,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,Ignorant peasants!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.98,0:39:39.30,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.30,0:39:41.76,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,the Supervisor is clearly stirring up trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.76,0:39:43.26,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Let me beat him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.26,0:39:45.00,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'll get him out of Anxi county!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.23,0:39:47.08,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third brother, don't be so reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.36,0:39:51.97,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,So I can't beat him or curse him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.97,0:39:54.62,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,T-This is... Intolerable!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.62,0:39:55.53,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.78,0:40:00.29,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.53,0:40:03.96,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.22,0:40:05.44,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I need a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.28,0:40:09.72,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother, don't be reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.81,0:40:15.26,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, I'm going outside the city to ride my horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.35,0:40:24.13,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Alright, but only outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.81,0:40:25.80,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.22,0:40:42.02,Default,Lackey Official,0,0,0,,Commandant Liu, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.24,0:40:50.12,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Master Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.12,0:40:53.08,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,The Supervisor's intimidating\Nthe officials against Lord Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.08,0:40:53.55,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.55,0:40:55.88,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Master Zhang, we asked him to show mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.88,0:40:58.14,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,but he wouldn't let us in, and he was beating somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.49,0:41:02.64,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.42,0:41:06.02,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You cur, where's Elder Brother!?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.84,0:41:08.21,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You bureaucratic cur!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.07,0:41:12.61,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.92,0:41:15.31,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.36,0:41:16.72,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You lowly cur!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.72,0:41:19.85,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'll beat you to death! I'll beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.06,0:41:23.42,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.42,0:41:24.51,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.51,0:41:26.61,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Let me get rid of a scumbag like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.12,0:41:28.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.05,0:41:32.19,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Supervisor, my Elder Brother has only been dutiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.19,0:41:34.68,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,He's honest and loves the people as if his own children!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.68,0:41:35.73,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Why try to harm him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.73,0:41:36.20,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.20,0:41:38.41,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You only know stealing and demanding bribes!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.41,0:41:39.84,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You're obviously greedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.84,0:41:42.80,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,My Elder Brother's done nothing!\NHow could he have the money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.80,0:41:45.51,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You sell positions and steal property!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.51,0:41:46.68,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What are your crimes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.68,0:41:47.71,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.71,0:41:48.32,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.32,0:41:50.68,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.68,0:41:57.16,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, good sirs, spare my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.00,0:42:03.01,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Elder Brother, you've achieved so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.01,0:42:05.22,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}yet you're only made a county commandant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.55,0:42:09.17,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}And now, you're slandered by this Supervisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.17,0:42:10.48,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Spare my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.80,0:42:14.61,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}As I see it, this place is a thorny bush, not fit for a phoenix to perch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.74,0:42:17.00,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Better to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.78,0:42:20.65,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Then resign this post and return to plan grand deeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.48,0:42:25.14,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Forgive me! I'll never do this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.14,0:42:26.50,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Those above compelled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.50,0:42:28.56,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Subordinates follow their superiors!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.13,0:42:30.66,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Supervisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.78,0:42:33.51,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You tried to frame the honest and harm the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.51,0:42:35.13,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I would put you down like a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.68,0:42:37.25,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,But I will spare you this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.11,0:42:41.73,Default,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Thank you for your great kindness, Lord Xuande!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.71,0:42:46.09,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,This is the seal of my post.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.15,0:42:51.40,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Keep it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.56,0:42:54.55,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.55,0:42:57.36,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu, please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.65,0:43:00.83,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.16,0:43:05.84,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.84,0:43:10.78,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu, please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.42,0:43:14.04,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.49,0:43:19.75,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.72,0:43:23.10,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.73,0:43:25.11,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.11,0:43:28.52,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Liu Bei and his brothers, evading persecution,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.52,0:43:31.58,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,became captains under Liu Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.00,0:43:34.96,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After Gongsun Zan advocated his past achievements,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.96,0:43:39.46,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,he was promoted to major and Prefect of Pingyuan County.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.46,0:43:44.78,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thus, he would gradually build up his power.

